{
  "embeddedAssets": {
    "assets": [
      {
        "dataBase64": "",
        "id": "sample.vfx-fire.flameSheet",
        "mime": "image/png",
        "name": "flame-flipbook.png"
      }
    ],
    "bindings": {
      "flameSheet": "sample.vfx-fire.flameSheet"
    }
  },
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Quad UV, the particle's normalised age (0 → 1), a per-particle random number and the particle colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_flip",
        "position": {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`frame = (age × speed + random) × 16`: every particle starts at a different frame, and the flame loops seamlessly because the sheet scrolls exactly one noise period. Current and next frame are fetched and cross-faded by the Flipbook node's *blend*."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_soft",
        "position": {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 849
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "The **Depth Intersection** kit fades the particle to 0 where it touches opaque geometry, hiding the hard intersection line of a flat quad."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_color",
        "position": {
          "x": 3108,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "**Color Ramp** maps the flame intensity to edge → body → core HDR colours; multiplied by *Intensity* and the particle colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_haze",
        "position": {
          "x": 3108,
          "y": 629
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1766
        },
        "text": "The scene colour is sampled at `screenUV + (I − ½, ΔI·4) × haze`, where ΔI is the difference between the two flipbook frames. The result replaces the background inside the flame's halo (`smoothstep(0, 0.25, I)`), so hot air wobbles the view behind the fire."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_mix",
        "position": {
          "x": 5078,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "`colour = lerp(distorted scene, flame, coverage)`, `coverage = saturate(1.8 I − 0.1)`; alpha = halo × soft fade × particle alpha. The haze is only visible through the halo, the flame covers it."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 6436,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Colour + alpha; blend mode Alpha, ZWrite off, two-sided."
      }
    ],
